        "grant side given its own normalising wrapper; the backend fixes only the check",
        "shared backend registered directly rather than reached by delegation",
        "plugin gating reversed back into scope as FR-033a, with D-015 recording why",
        "cross-record identifier uniqueness lifted onto the shared abstract",
        "T004 folded, T053 restated against the migration's forward function"
      ]
